direction: right
title: Databricks Compute Comparison Matrix

AllPurpose: 1. All-Purpose Compute {
  style.stroke: "#38BDF8"
  Workload: Interactive Notebook Prototyping
  Cost: High DBU (~0.50 DBU/hr)
  Lifecycle: Persistent until manual stop
  Rule: NEVER run production jobs here!
}

JobCompute: 2. Job Compute Clusters {
  style.stroke: "#34D399"
  Workload: Automated Production Workflows & ETL
  Cost: 50% Cheaper (~0.20 DBU/hr)
  Lifecycle: Ephemeral (Auto-destroys immediately)
  Rule: Mandatory for all scheduled pipelines!
}

SQLWarehouse: 3. Serverless SQL Warehouses {
  style.stroke: "#C084FC"
  Workload: BI Dashboards & Analyst SQL
  Cost: Auto-stopping Serverless Pool
  Lifecycle: Starts in <2s, scales horizontally
  Rule: Photon-native for maximum query speed
}
